        "name": "Injection",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The term is bound via a `?` placeholder with `%`, `_` and `\\` escaped under an ESCAPE clause and nothing user-controlled reaches the SQL text; the only deviation is that the surrounding `%` wildcards are concatenated in SQL (`'%' || ? || '%'`) rather than placed in the bound value, which is equally safe."
